1
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,000
My lady,

2
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:01,560
I have matters to attend to at home.

3
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:02,640
I'll head back first.

4
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:04,840
Summon me anytime if you need anything.

5
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,720
Why are you two still here?

6
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,440
Yes.

7
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,440
Acting like dogs?

8
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:12,039
Yes.

9
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:12,640
Let's go.

10
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:13,720
Yes.

11
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,520
Boss, the police are here.

12
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:33,240
I didn't know Superintendent Li was coming.

13
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,050
What can I do for you?

14
00:01:36,440 --> 00:01:37,240
Chief Lei,

15
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:39,180
we are just following orders.

16
00:01:39,440 --> 00:01:40,520
Come with us.

17
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:44,720
Is there some kind of misunderstanding?

18
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,920
Cut the crap.

19
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:48,039
Take him away.

20
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,240
I'll go find Ningning later.

21
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,100
What about you?

22
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,960
I'll go back to the stronghold.

23
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:04,920
I'll see if there are any new clues.

24
00:02:04,920 --> 00:02:06,650
I'll meet up with you tomorrow.

25
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,160
Young Master.

26
00:02:18,040 --> 00:02:18,570
Bai Weng,

27
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,120
any news on the missing brothers?

28
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,520
I fear the worst.

29
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,280
The Jiuhe Gang recruited them with high temporary wages

30
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,340
and took them away.

31
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:27,570
There has been no news for half a month.

32
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:28,280
I'm afraid

33
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:31,120
they were transported far away to work as illegal laborers.

34
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:31,680
Or

35
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:33,170
they were murdered.

36
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,800
Make proper arrangements for the relatives of those brothers.

37
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:40,640
Detective Jiang has been investigating the case of the pile of bones in the suburbs of the capital,

38
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:41,920
and he has some leads.

39
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,040
All of this should be connected.

40
00:02:44,040 --> 00:02:45,840
I reckon it's the work of the same group of people.

41
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,640
Young Master,

42
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,840
we have many hidden contacts in Phoenix City

43
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:49,960
who will come when called.

44
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,490
You must not take any risks.

45
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,440
Hasn't Lei Lie been caught?

46
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,120
Why are you still so unhappy?

47
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:03,040
I just feel this case was solved too easily.

48
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,820
The evidence Jinwen left before he died,

49
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:08,400
and the clues my dad left after he died...

50
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,800
Unless...

51
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,500
he was certain he wouldn't get into trouble.

52
00:03:15,520 --> 00:03:16,250
Li Chengrui.

53
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,930
Why did you release Lei Lie?

54
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:19,720
This contract

55
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,640
clearly states

56
00:03:21,920 --> 00:03:24,200
that the buyer of this batch of banned drugs

57
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:27,240
is Jiang Tianlin and his Hengtong Company.

58
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:31,040
But these goods were

59
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:33,100
found in the Jiuhe Gang's warehouse.

60
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,640
Back then,

61
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:38,079
Jiang Tianlin used the excuse that his warehouse was full

62
00:03:38,079 --> 00:03:39,920
to negotiate a cooperation with the Jiuhe Gang.

63
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:41,480
The accounts of both parties

64
00:03:41,480 --> 00:03:42,680
show it very clearly.

65
00:03:42,920 --> 00:03:43,560
However,

66
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:45,920
in the inventory column,

67
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,040
it says coffee beans.

68
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,720
Jiang Tianlin deliberately concealed it

69
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:50,720
and handed over the warehouse keys.

70
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:52,640
Naturally, Lei Lie didn't know.

71
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,240
What else is there that I, the person in charge of the investigation,

72
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,400
don't know?

73
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,360
Come in.

74
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:01,320
Superintendent,

75
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:03,920
Hengtong Warehouse and the Jiang Residence have been sealed.

76
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,040
Please advise.

77
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:07,720
Siyao,

78
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:09,120
I have

79
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,400
always been fair.

80
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:12,400
Jiang Tianlin is Jiang Tianlin,

81
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,260
and you are you.

82
00:04:13,600 --> 00:04:14,200
You just

83
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,380
focus on your work.

84
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:19,240
Fenghuang Police Station is still waiting for you to solve cases.

85
00:04:19,240 --> 00:04:21,720
Thank you for your fairness, Superintendent Li.

86
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,250
I will definitely keep this fairness in mind.

87
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,210
You're welcome.

88
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,800
Senior Sister.

89
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:38,320
Miss.

90
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,640
You're finally back.

91
00:04:41,120 --> 00:04:42,520
Don't worry, Mrs. Liu.

92
00:04:42,520 --> 00:04:44,440
I won't let you end up with nowhere to go.

93
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:46,240
Ningning, help me take care of Mrs. Liu.

94
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,560
Where are you going?

95
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,400
I'll be right back.

96
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:54,060
She isn't going to find Lei Lie alone, is she?

97
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:56,840
Ayao.

98
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,440
You're here.

99
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:00,360
Sir.

100
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,500
I really don't know what to do.

101
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,560
What do you need me to do for you?

102
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:07,000
There are dirty cops in the police force.

103
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:07,640
Ayao.

104
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,520
The world is in chaos now.

105
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,320
No matter where you are,

106
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,520
everyone is just

107
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:14,720
looking for a reason to live.

108
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,050
Should I just ignore it?

109
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,440
The piles of bones in the suburbs...

110
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,200
Did any of them die in the war?

111
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,800
There is no war,

112
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:23,120
yet they were brutally murdered by their compatriots,

113
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:25,450
becoming victims of power and interests.

114
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,520
Ayao.

115
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:30,250
I knew I wasn't wrong about you.

116
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:31,400
Go back

117
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,050
and wait for my news.

118
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:36,640
The deaths of the two people closest to me

119
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:37,970
are both related to you.

120
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:40,600
Lei Lie, what the hell are you doing?

121
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,920
Detective Jiang,

122
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,600
to show off like this in my Lei residence,

123
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:10,520
you are

124
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,080
the first one.

125
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,840
I can kill you right now.

126
00:06:16,840 --> 00:06:17,840
Kill me.

127
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,080
Shoot.

128
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,680
Once the gun goes off,

129
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:23,120
I'll be dead.

130
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,200
Detective Jiang,

131
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,800
you can finally get your revenge.

132
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,720
But if I die,

133
00:06:31,880 --> 00:06:33,320
you won't live either.

134
00:06:34,280 --> 00:06:35,120
Is it worth it?

135
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,720
You've harmed so many people.

136
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,520
You can't die so easily.

137
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,200
You'd better stay alive

138
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,320
and wait for me to arrest you.

139
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,120
Detective Jiang, don't chicken out.

140
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,480
Where are you going?

141
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,200
My Lei residence

142
00:06:53,480 --> 00:06:55,140
isn't a place you can just come

143
00:06:55,440 --> 00:06:56,720
and go as you please.

144
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,520
Besides,

145
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:01,360
I've prepared a big gift for you.

146
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:03,600
Don't you want to see it?

147
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:08,920
Shi An.

148
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:09,920
Siyao.

149
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:11,520
I'm sorry.

150
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:20,080
Where is Jiang Siyao?

151
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,400
Chief Lei.

152
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,280
This kid is not bad.

153
00:07:25,960 --> 00:07:26,960
He's got courage.

154
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,360
Let him go.

155
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:31,520
Why should I?

156
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:32,560
Besides,

157
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,560
I can let him go,

158
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,770
but what will you trade for him?

159
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,560
If police and bandits weren't sworn enemies,

160
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:42,090
I'd really like to be friends with you.

161
00:07:42,159 --> 00:07:44,240
Cut the crap and let him go.

162
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,760
Let him go?

163
00:07:49,960 --> 00:07:50,960
I could do that.

164
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:52,680
But I

165
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,880
have a condition.

166
00:07:55,640 --> 00:07:56,570
What condition?

167
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,000
Replace the gate

168
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,560
of my house.

169
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,040
Investigate all you want,

170
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,620
but why kick down the gate?

171
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:12,040
Does it hurt?

172
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:17,360
I didn't expect Chief Lei to be so fierce at his age.

173
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:19,760
No, Ye Shi'an,

174
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:20,880
are you crazy?

175
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,360
I am a police officer.

176
00:08:22,440 --> 00:08:23,480
For my husband

177
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,560
and my father,

178
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,760
it's worth it if I die.

179
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,620
What about you?

180
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,880
You're just a bandit from a bandit lair.

181
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:31,480
If you die, only your family will be sad for you.

182
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:35,120
I will investigate the mass grave case in the Beijing suburbs to the end.

183
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,720
And the case of your brothers in Xinfeng Stronghold,

184
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:38,380
I will investigate it as well.

185
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:40,020
Go back and be a good miner.

186
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:42,340
Actually, I am really useful.

187
00:08:42,799 --> 00:08:45,320
I just let myself be

188
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:47,080
caught by Lei Lie on purpose

189
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:49,960
so I could check his accounts at his mansion.

190
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:52,120
I accidentally found this letter.

191
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:57,080
Bai Xianming.

192
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,360
Professor Bai.

193
00:09:00,160 --> 00:09:02,840
Know your destiny and change your luck.

194
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:05,440
Palm reading and face reading.

195
00:09:05,640 --> 00:09:07,480
Past and present lives,

196
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:08,920
karma and retribution,

197
00:09:09,400 --> 00:09:12,320
all revealed one by one.

198
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,520
What do you want from me?

199
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:15,120
Actually,

200
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,320
it's the information Detective Jiang asked you for.

201
00:09:16,320 --> 00:09:17,250
She's in a hurry.

202
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:18,720
Okay.

203
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:19,770
Wait for me here.

204
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:24,680
This little hand...

205
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:26,240
You can definitely trust me.

206
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,960
I looked through it on the way back.

207
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,960
This Bai Xianming

208
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,360
has a complicated relationship with St. George's Hospital.

209
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:33,480
St. George's Hospital sends him money almost every month.

210
00:09:33,480 --> 00:09:35,280
St. George's Hospital is in the British Concession,

211
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,720
and it's a missionary hospital.

212
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,240
We can't investigate it at all.

213
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:40,160
I heard Huo Qishan mention this.

214
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:43,200
He went to see a Western doctor when he visited the hospital.

215
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:44,930
This is the hospital he went to.

216
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,280
We're here. Take care.

217
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,480
Coming.

218
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:50,160
Keep a close eye on him.

219
00:09:51,680 --> 00:09:52,940
Professor Bai went in.

220
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,200
Ningning,

221
00:10:04,680 --> 00:10:06,940
wait at the door and be ready to back us up.

222
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,880
My stomach hurts.

223
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:12,200
No.

224
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,640
I need to see a doctor.

225
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,800
Look at this.

226
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:44,690
St. George's Hospital often holds free charity events.

227
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,840
The sponsor of this event is Lei Lie,

228
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:49,280
and the person in charge is Bai Xianming.

229
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:51,480
Bai Xianming is a professor at Beiyang University.

230
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:55,010
Why would he participate in a project at St. George's Hospital?

231
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:57,120
There must be something wrong with this.
